---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="SR Soft LLC — AI consulting, grounded in enterprise reality"
  description="SR Soft LLC — AI consulting, grounded in enterprise reality. ERP, AI, data, pharma, and cloud consulting from Sugar Land, Texas."
  bodyData="v2"
>
<!-- ============================================================
     HERO V2 — Centered editorial
     Refined identity stack + huge serif headline.
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="hero-v2 hero-v2-centered" data-screen-label="01 Hero">
  <canvas id="particle-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-v2-center">
      <div class="hero-v2-id">
        <div class="hero-v2-mark" id="hero-mark">
          <img src="/logo-mark.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
        </div>
        <div class="hero-v2-id-text">
          <span class="name">SR Soft LLC</span>
          <span class="meta">SAP since 2004 · AI since 2022 · Sugar Land, TX</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-v2-headline">AI Consulting Firm</h1>

      <p class="hero-v2-subhead">Built in <span>SAP</span>.<span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"> </span>Building in <span>AI</span>.</p>

      <p class="hero-v2-lead">Two decades of enterprise SAP work — implementations, migrations, support. Today our consultants are deep in SAP BTP, ABAP Cloud, and Joule, and in the AI systems built around them. The future of enterprise software is AI on top of the data and processes SAP has run for thirty years. That's the work we do.</p>

      <div class="hero-v2-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule a consultation <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="#practices" class="btn btn-outline">See our practices</a>
      </div>

      <a href="/careers" class="hero-v2-hiring">
        <span class="hiring-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Actively hiring across all practices</span>
        <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     MANIFESTO — Three crisp operating statements
     A quiet editorial strip that establishes the worldview
     before the marketing fireworks.
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="manifesto" data-screen-label="02 Manifesto">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="manifesto-grid reveal">
      <div class="manifesto-label">How we work</div>
      <div class="manifesto-item">
        <span class="num">01 /</span>
        <h3>Strategy <em>beats stack.</em></h3>
        <p>The right model on the wrong process produces nothing useful. We start with the workflow, not the technology.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="manifesto-item">
        <span class="num">02 /</span>
        <h3>If we can't explain it, <em>we won't ship it.</em></h3>
        <p>Every system we deliver, we can defend. Architecture, decisions, tradeoffs — written down, agreed to before code gets written.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="manifesto-item">
        <span class="num">03 /</span>
        <h3>The goal is to make ourselves <em>unnecessary.</em></h3>
        <p>Engagements end with documentation, training, and a team that can extend the work without us. Retainers are for new problems, not maintenance debt.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     SHOWCASE BRIDGE — Marquee + scroll-driven stats
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="showcase-bridge" id="showcase" aria-label="Clients and credibility" data-screen-label="03 Clients">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="showcase-stage">

      <div class="showcase-marquee-wrap">
        <div class="logo-marquee" aria-label="Client and partner logos">
          <div class="logo-marquee-track showcase-track">
            <span class="logo-item s-bold">Apple</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-allcaps">Microsoft</span>
            <span class="logo-item">GSK</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-sans">Moderna</span>
            <span class="logo-item">Astellas</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-bold">Biogen</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-allcaps">Pepsi</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-sans">Costco</span>
            <span class="logo-item">CVS&nbsp;Pharmacy</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-bold">Delta</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-mono">bp</span>
            <span class="logo-item">Fidelity</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-thin">LyondellBasell</span>
            <span class="logo-item">Flowers&nbsp;Foods</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-sans">Cognizant</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-mono">accenture</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-bold">Tech&nbsp;Mahindra</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-bold" aria-hidden="true">Apple</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-allcaps" aria-hidden="true">Microsoft</span>
            <span class="logo-item" aria-hidden="true">GSK</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-sans" aria-hidden="true">Moderna</span>
            <span class="logo-item" aria-hidden="true">Astellas</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-bold" aria-hidden="true">Biogen</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-allcaps" aria-hidden="true">Pepsi</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-sans" aria-hidden="true">Costco</span>
            <span class="logo-item" aria-hidden="true">CVS&nbsp;Pharmacy</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-bold" aria-hidden="true">Delta</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-mono" aria-hidden="true">bp</span>
            <span class="logo-item" aria-hidden="true">Fidelity</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-thin" aria-hidden="true">LyondellBasell</span>
            <span class="logo-item" aria-hidden="true">Flowers&nbsp;Foods</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-sans" aria-hidden="true">Cognizant</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-mono" aria-hidden="true">accenture</span>
            <span class="logo-item s-bold" aria-hidden="true">Tech&nbsp;Mahindra</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-intro reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Work</p>
        <h2 class="display-3">Real systems for <em>Fortune 500 enterprises.</em></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-stats">
        <div class="bridge-stat">
          <div class="bridge-stat-num"><span data-target="20">20</span><span class="plus">+</span></div>
          <div class="bridge-stat-label">Years in SAP</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bridge-stat">
          <div class="bridge-stat-num"><span data-target="500">500</span><span class="plus">+</span></div>
          <div class="bridge-stat-label">Consultants placed</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bridge-stat">
          <div class="bridge-stat-num"><span data-target="150">150</span><span class="plus">+</span></div>
          <div class="bridge-stat-label">Engagements</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bridge-stat">
          <div class="bridge-stat-num"><span data-target="15">15</span><span class="plus">+</span></div>
          <div class="bridge-stat-label">Fortune 500</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     THE GAP — Light-theme pivot, the narrative crux
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="section" id="problem" data-screen-label="04 The Gap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">The gap</p>
      <h2 class="display-3">Most consulting work doesn't <em>survive Monday morning.</em></h2>
      <p>Strategy decks land. Implementations stall. Vendors disappear. Whether the project is AI, ERP, data, or pharma — the failure pattern is usually the same.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid cols-2 reveal">
      <article class="grid-item problem-card">
        <p class="practice-tag">Artificial Intelligence</p>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-chat-bubble user">Draft the Q3 update for the board.</div>
          <div class="mock-chat-bubble">Sure — here's a generic template based on what most companies write…</div>
          <div class="mock-chat-bubble"><span class="typing"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div>
        </div>
        <h3>Generic AI projects that don't survive go-live.</h3>
        <p>Off-the-shelf tools work in demos and break in production. The problem isn't the model — it's that nothing was built around how the business actually runs.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="grid-item problem-card">
        <p class="practice-tag">ERP Consulting</p>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot live"></span><span>S/4HANA module · phase 3</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot"></span><span class="mock-bar"></span><span class="mock-tag">behind</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot"></span><span>User adoption</span><span class="mock-tag">23%</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot"></span><span>Workarounds in production</span><span class="mock-tag">14</span></div>
        </div>
        <h3>ERP rollouts that miss what users actually need.</h3>
        <p>Months of configuration, training, and change management — and the system still doesn't fit how the work happens. Adoption stays low. Workarounds proliferate.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="grid-item problem-card">
        <p class="practice-tag">Pharma &amp; Life Sciences</p>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <pre class="mock-code"><span class="kw">audit</span>: Q4 prep
  <span class="str"># T-minus 14 days</span>
  csv_docs:    <span class="kw">incomplete</span>
  iq_oq_pq:    <span class="kw">drafted</span>
  21cfr11:     <span class="str">"need review"</span>
  <span class="kw">status</span>: at-risk</pre>
        </div>
        <h3>Compliance treated as an afterthought.</h3>
        <p>Validation sprints in the final week before audit. Documentation that won't pass inspection. Regulated work isn't something you bolt on at the end.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="grid-item problem-card">
        <p class="practice-tag">Talent &amp; Resourcing</p>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot"></span><span>SAP consultant · req open</span><span class="mock-tag">94d</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot"></span><span>Data engineer · sourcing</span><span class="mock-tag">62d</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot"></span><span>AI/ML engineer · interviewing</span><span class="mock-tag">41d</span></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="mock-dot live"></span><span>Project at risk</span><span class="mock-tag">red</span></div>
        </div>
        <h3>Talent gaps that quietly stall every initiative.</h3>
        <p>Even the best strategy fails without the right people executing. Hiring is slow, training is generic, and good consultants leave before they're fully ramped.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     PRACTICES — Editorial numbered rows
     Replaces the old 3×2 services grid with a more confident,
     editorial list layout. Each row is a link to the deep page.
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="practices" id="practices" data-screen-label="05 Practices">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
      <h2 class="display-3">Six practices.<br><em>One operating philosophy.</em></h2>
      <p>Whether you're modernizing ERP, deploying AI, or building the data foundation underneath both — we lead with strategy and ship with discipline.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="practices-list reveal">
      <a href="/services#ai" class="practice-row">
        <span class="num">01 / AI</span>
        <h3>Artificial Intelligence</h3>
        <p class="desc">Strategy, custom AI applications, autonomous agents, and RAG systems. From use-case discovery to production deployment — with the governance layer most projects skip.
          <span class="stack">OpenAI · Anthropic · LangChain · Databricks</span>
        </p>
        <span class="arrow">Read more →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/services#erp" class="practice-row">
        <span class="num">02 / ERP</span>
        <h3>ERP Consulting</h3>
        <p class="desc">SAP S/4HANA, Oracle, Salesforce, Workday, PeopleSoft. Implementation, migration, optimization, and post-go-live support across the major platforms.
          <span class="stack">SAP · Oracle · Salesforce · Workday</span>
        </p>
        <span class="arrow">Read more →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/services#data" class="practice-row">
        <span class="num">03 / Data</span>
        <h3>Data Engineering</h3>
        <p class="desc">Modern data architecture, pipelines, warehousing — the foundation work that makes analytics and AI possible upstream.
          <span class="stack">Snowflake · Databricks · dbt · Airflow</span>
        </p>
        <span class="arrow">Read more →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/services#pharma" class="practice-row">
        <span class="num">04 / Pharma</span>
        <h3>Pharma &amp; Life Sciences</h3>
        <p class="desc">Validation, CSV, GxP, 21 CFR Part 11 compliance, clinical data management. Decades of regulated-industry experience embedded in the team.
          <span class="stack">GAMP 5 · 21 CFR Part 11 · CSA · ICH</span>
        </p>
        <span class="arrow">Read more →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/services#cloud" class="practice-row">
        <span class="num">05 / Cloud</span>
        <h3>Cloud Services</h3>
        <p class="desc">AWS, Azure, GCP. Migration, modernization, architecture, and FinOps — built for the realities of enterprise IT, not greenfield startups.
          <span class="stack">AWS · Azure · GCP · Kubernetes · Terraform</span>
        </p>
        <span class="arrow">Read more →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/services#management" class="practice-row">
        <span class="num">06 / Mgmt</span>
        <h3>Management Consulting</h3>
        <p class="desc">Process design, digital transformation, change management — strategy built into every implementation, not filed in a drawer.
          <span class="stack">Lean · Agile · SAFe · Prosci · TOGAF</span>
        </p>
        <span class="arrow">Read more →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     INDUSTRIES
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="section" data-screen-label="06 Industries">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where we work</p>
      <h2 class="display-3">Deep expertise in <em>regulated and complex</em> industries.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="industries-grid reveal">
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">01</span><h4>Life Sciences &amp; Pharma</h4><p>Astellas, Biogen, GSK, Moderna, CVS</p></div>
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">02</span><h4>Financial Services</h4><p>Fidelity National Financial</p></div>
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">03</span><h4>Manufacturing &amp; Energy</h4><p>BP, LyondellBasell</p></div>
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">04</span><h4>Consumer &amp; Retail</h4><p>Costco, Pepsi, Flowers Foods</p></div>
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">05</span><h4>Technology</h4><p>Apple, Microsoft</p></div>
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">06</span><h4>Travel &amp; Logistics</h4><p>Delta</p></div>
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">07</span><h4>Consulting Partners</h4><p>Cognizant, Accenture, Tech Mahindra</p></div>
      <div class="industry-tile"><span class="industry-num">08</span><h4>Public Sector</h4><p>State and federal agencies</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     FINAL CTA V2 — Asymmetric, more gravitas
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="final-cta-v2" id="cta" data-screen-label="07 CTA">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="final-cta-v2-grid">
      <h2>Have a system worth modernizing?<br><em>Let's talk.</em></h2>
      <div class="cta-side">
        <p>Thirty-minute call. We'll listen, ask hard questions, and tell you honestly whether we can help.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="align-self:flex-start;">Schedule a consultation <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <div class="contact-row">
          <span>or reach us</span>
          <a href="mailto:admin@srsoftllc.com">admin@srsoftllc.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-row" style="border-top:none;padding-top:0;">
          <span>by phone</span>
          <a href="tel:+17328352220">+1 732&middot;835&middot;2220</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
